 339:Core/Src/ow.c **** /**
 340:Core/Src/ow.c ****  * @brief Transfer a command and optional data to/from a specific 1-Wire device by ROM ID index.
 341:Core/Src/ow.c ****  * @param[in] handle Pointer to the 1-Wire handle structure.
